{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫戀綜《女神配對計劃2》向來標榜參賽者真實尋愛，惟近日卻爆出震撼緋聞。</p><p>有指女神之一的俞可程在本月5日深夜，與一名戴眼鏡男子於天水圍天盛苑一帶表現親暱，男方更被起底為同公司導演，且疑似已有家室，令俞可程捲入「小三」及「講大話」風波。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T04:24:06.223925+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:08:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T04:17:14.963581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T04:17:14.963581+00:00","content_hash":"ffb0fc6dca782a816aad46446538127abe3fff267bfc052d4542265fbe1b754c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}